&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;(注)１．「完全議決権株式(その他)」欄の普通株式には、証券保管振替機構名義の株式が400株(議決権４個)含まれて&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　　　おります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　２．「単元未満株式」欄には、自己保有株式が次のとおり含まれております。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:45pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:67.5pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
