  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row5Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;　　５．保有銘柄の子会社である㈱みずほ銀行は、当社の株式を保有しております。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
